{
  "name": "Bridge of the Deep Delving",
  "provenance": "Composed for this pack by an Agentlings designer. The scene, geometry, figures, lighting and palette are original work; far.png and mid.png were rendered here with three.js through render_plate and ship with the pack. The setting is an original interpretation of a situation from J.R.R. Tolkien's The Lord of the Rings (1954, in copyright) — a grey pilgrim holding a narrow span against a horned fire-demon in the deep halls of a delved mountain. mid.png carries the two figures: both were drawn as flat polygons to coordinates written here, from the description in the prose (a grey robe, a broad-brimmed hat, a staff and a sword; a shadow-shape whose mane was kindled, with a whip of flame). Nothing is reproduced from any edition, film, game or third-party artwork: no text, marks, names, logos, character designs, poses or reference images were used, and no character is named in the pack. Reusable within this repository under the repository's own terms.",
